homa Society.  &lt;a href=&quot;https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lls.org%2Fmyeloproliferative-neoplasms%2Fmyelofibrosis&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Camandine.baufayt%40abbvie.com%7Cf8d4478ec13643957f9108dd18439796%7C6f4d03de95514ba1a25bdce6f5ab7ace%7C0%7C0%7C638693400763976814%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=8qSqYW93Z4ZkWKH%2F9DZrQtEh0QWQNNNuudQvV%2Fsuftw%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;>https://www.lls.org/myeloproliferative-neoplasms/myelofibrosis&lt;/a>, Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Momenimovahed Z, et al. Ovarian cancer in the world: epidemiology and risk factors. &lt;i>Int J Womens Health&lt;/i>. 2019;11:287-299. Published 2019 Apr 30. doi:10.2147/IJWH.S197604&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Institut Roi Albert II, Cancer de l’ovaire, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.institutroialbertdeux.be/fr/cancer/cancer-de-lovaire#:~:text=Le%20cancer%20de%20l'ovaire,cas%20par%20an%20en%20Belgique&quot;>https://www.institutroialbertdeux.be/fr/cancer/cancer-de-lovaire#:~:text=Le%20cancer%20de%20l'ovaire,cas%20par%20an%20en%20Belgique&lt;/a>., Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Institut National du cancer, Cancers de l’ovaire : les médicaments anticancéreux, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-cancer.fr/Patients-et-proches/Les-cancers/Cancer-de-l-ovaire/La-chimiotherapie-et-les-therapies-ciblees&quot;>https://www.e-cancer.fr/Patients-et-proches/Les-cancers/Cancer-de-l-ovaire/La-chimiotherapie-et-les-therapies-ciblees&lt;/a>, Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Kim, A., Ueda, Y., Naka, T. &lt;i>et al.&lt;/i> Therapeutic strategies in epithelial ovarian cancer. &lt;i>J Exp Clin Cancer Res&lt;/i> &lt;b>31&lt;/b>, 14 (2012). &lt;a href=&quot;https://doi.org/10.1186/1756-9966-31-14&quot;>https://doi.org/10.1186/1756-9966-31-14&lt;/a>&lt;